- project = @notification.project
- fee_pct = ENV.fetch('PLATFORM_FEE', '5.0').to_f / 100.0
- gross = project.contributions.where(payment_method: 'Stripe', stripe_transferred: true).sum(:value).to_f
- gross = project.contributions.where(payment_method: 'Stripe', state: 'confirmed').sum(:value).to_f if gross == 0
- net = (gross * (1.0 - fee_pct)).round(2)
- currency_sym = project.currency || 'EUR'

|Dear #{project.user.display_name},
br
br
strong | 🎉 Great news! Your funds are on their way.
br
br
|Your payout request for project #{link_to(project.name, project_url(project))} has been successfully processed by our team.
br
br
table[style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 500px;"]
  tr[style="background: #f0fdf4;"]
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; font-weight: bold;"] Project
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;"] #{project.name}
  tr
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: bold;"] Amount collected
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;"] #{number_to_currency(gross, unit: currency_sym, format: '%n %u')}
  tr
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: bold;"] Commission (#{(fee_pct * 100).to_i}%)
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; color: #d97706;"] − #{number_to_currency((gross * fee_pct).round(2), unit: currency_sym, format: '%n %u')}
  tr[style="background: #dcfce7;"]
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; font-weight: bold;"] NET transfer amount
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; color: #16a34a; font-weight: bold;"] #{number_to_currency(net, unit: currency_sym, format: '%n %u')}
  tr[style="background: #f8fafc;"]
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: bold;"] Estimated delay
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;"] 2 to 7 business days
br
br
|Funds will be credited directly to your registered bank account. You will receive a second email once the transfer has arrived in your account.
br
br
|If you have not received the funds after 7 business days, contact us at #{mail_to Configuration[:email_contact]}.
br
br
|Thank you for your trust,
br
|The #{Configuration[:company_name]} team
